# OpenExec local state
#
# A per-checkout SQLite database, its logs, checkpoints and artifacts: what this
# machine did in this repository, not what the repository is. Ignored as a
# directory rather than by extension, because the tool adds new state files
# without asking. Anything in here that is genuinely source — a committed
# openexec.yaml, a stories.json — stays tracked: .gitignore does not affect a
# file that is already in the index.
.openexec/
